<p>Kounain me hai ghul ke Payambar guzar gaye,<br>
Haq ke habeeb ashaqe dawar guzar gaye.</p>

<p>Ek kafera ne zeher Mohammed ko dediya,<br>
Sad haif iske sadme se Sarwar guzar gaye.</p>

<p>Hazrat pe qaak padhti thi pathar baraste the,<br>
Kya kya na zulm sehke Payambar guzar gaye.</p>

<p>Hussain qaak udate hai roti hai Fatima,<br>
Betaab Murtuza hai biradar guzar gaye.</p>

<p>Pyaro ko sheh ne rakh diya talwar ke tale,<br>
Ummat ka beda paar lagakar guzar gaye.</p>

<p>Zehra yateem hogayi bekas huwe Ali,<br>
Veera'n Madina hogaya Sarwar guzar gaye.</p>

<p>Betaab hai 'Hussaini' nawase Rasool ke,<br>
Daghe firaagh deke Payambar guzar gaye...</p>